also `x`. If only `y` is present, `x` the plot is interpreted as a
cheater plot and is filled in using the `y` values. `x` and `y` may
either be 2D arrays matching with each dimension matching that of `a` and
`b`, or they may be 1D arrays with total length equal to that of `a` and
`b`.
